WEBVTT

00:09:58.742 --> 00:10:01.236
(smeh)

00:10:02.266 --> 00:10:04.144
In počutila sem se tudi,

00:10:04.168 --> 00:10:08.593
kot da imam ta res nenavadni
filozofski privilegij,

00:10:08.617 --> 00:10:11.281
kako razumeti ljubezen.

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:16.650
Laboratorij mi je ponudil, da bo
moj kavdat natisnil s 3D tiskalnikom.

00:10:17.358 --> 00:10:19.431
Ljubezen sem lahko držala v roki.

00:10:19.455 --> 00:10:20.822
(smeh)

00:10:21.201 --> 00:10:22.368
Dala sem ga vliti v bron

00:10:22.392 --> 00:10:25.863
in ga predelala v ogrlico in jo prodajala
na svojih nastopih.

00:10:25.887 --> 00:10:28.669
(smeh)

00:10:28.693 --> 00:10:35.040
(aplavz)